$ sspur verify contracts.ssp
fn find_slot
  pre 0 <= lo and lo <= hi and hi <= sorted.len proved: at 3 call sites
  post r >= lo and r <= hi                     proved
fn average
  n where _ > 0                                no callers
  post r * n <= total                          counterexample: average(total = -1, n = 2): contract violated: post r * n <= total in average (r = 0)
